<h2>Solve Problems Involving Time (Part 2)</h2>
<h3>Warm-up Han's band practice</h3><p>Han ate dinner before riding bus and hurries to band practice. Discuss what time information would be needed; the original warm-up has no fixed dinner/practice hours.</p>
<h3>Activity1 On the Bus Again</h3><p>Han source clock starts <strong>5:42</strong> and ends <strong>6:37</strong>. Original Section Summary count: +3 to5:45, +15 to6:00, +30 to6:30, +7 to6:37. <strong>Total55 minutes.</strong></p>
<p>Elena waited <strong>32 minutes</strong>. Draw the missing minute hand on ORIGINAL source clock and justify. Teacher text says 36−32=4; the source clock HOURS have not been verified visually. No manufactured start or end hour is supplied.</p>
